I'm in meetings all day. I need you to buy {gift_count} gift cards of {gift_value} each for a client thank-you {deadline}. Send me the codes by email. I'll reimburse you.

{sender_first}

Parcel {tracking_no} is being held at our depot.

Open the attached form and return it to release your parcel.

{brand}

Hi {recipient_first},

Are you available? I need help with a confidential task. Please reply with your mobile number.

{sender_first}

Hello {recipient_first}, I'm travelling and can only use email. Reply when you see this.

Thanks,
{sender_first} {sender_last}

