Open the attached notice {deadline}. Failure to respond will result in further action.

Ref: {ref_no}

Your account is scheduled for closure.

Reply to this message {deadline} with the word KEEP to stop the closure.

Ref: {ref_no}

Hi all,

A quick update for week {week_no}: the {project} review went well and the next milestone is on track. Thanks for the hard work.

{sender_first}

Hello,

Summary of the {project} call: we agreed the budget and will meet again on {weekday}. Shout if I missed anything.

{sender_first} {sender_last}

